    "headline": "KTM 200 Duke gets a quickshifter, traction control and ride modes at ₹2.07 lakh",
    "text": "KTM has launched the updated 200 Duke at ₹2,07,140 ex-showroom, Delhi, ₹1,552 more than before. Ride-by-wire, a bi-directional quickshifter, traction control and two ride modes, Street and Rain, are now standard, set through the TFT display. KTM also adds Crawl Assist for stop-and-go traffic and two colours, Liquid Carbon and Slate Grey. The 199.5cc single still makes 25hp and 19.3Nm, and the WP Apex 43mm USD fork and trellis frame carry over.",
    "why": "Rider aids from the 390 Duke reach KTM’s first Indian motorcycle, which now takes on 250s with equipment as well as price.",
